WEBVTT

00:07:27.496 --> 00:07:30.871
the Harvard Business School did
a study on the economics of

00:07:30.871 --> 00:07:33.913
the Black List and found that
movies on the black list,

00:07:33.913 --> 00:07:35.954
when controlling for every other factor,

00:07:35.954 --> 00:07:37.121
movies made from scripts on

00:07:37.121 --> 00:07:41.871
the Black List made 90 percent more in
revenue than movies made from scripts,

00:07:41.871 --> 00:07:44.454
not on the black list. And
I want to say it again,

00:07:44.454 --> 00:07:48.538
because I think that it can't be
emphasized enough that movies on

00:07:48.538 --> 00:07:49.996
the planet that were made from scripts on

00:07:49.996 --> 00:07:53.996
the Black List made 90 percent more than
movies that were made from scripts not

00:07:53.996 --> 00:07:56.079
on the Blacklist. And there's
one reason why,

00:07:56.079 --> 00:07:59.538
which is if you start with
a great screenplay,

00:07:59.538 --> 00:08:01.913
you have a better chance of
making a great movie.